---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy | Sparaton Studios" description="Sparaton Studios privacy information.">
<section class="shell hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p><h1>Collect less. Explain what remains.</h1></div><p class="lede">This page is a launch-draft disclosure and requires owner or legal review before production use.</p></section>
<section class="section"><article class="shell" style="max-width:54rem;line-height:1.8"><h2 style="font-size:2.4rem">What the site may collect</h2><p>When you create an inquiry, Sparaton may process your name, email address, inquiry details, messages, and attachments you choose to provide. Operational logs may include security and abuse-prevention information.</p><h2 style="font-size:2.4rem;margin-top:3rem">Why it is used</h2><p>Ticket data is used to verify access, respond to inquiries, maintain the conversation, prevent abuse, and operate the service. Internal staff notes are not sent to clients.</p><h2 style="font-size:2.4rem;margin-top:3rem">Analytics</h2><p>The planned analytics implementation is privacy-respecting and uses Cloudflare services when configured. Production must not display fabricated traffic data.</p><h2 style="font-size:2.4rem;margin-top:3rem">Owner review required</h2><p>Retention periods, legal basis, jurisdiction-specific rights, processor details, and an official privacy contact must be confirmed before public launch.</p></article></section>
</BaseLayout>
